WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.620
Ah, er... what was I going to say?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.100
Ah! Keep your room well-lit and
don't sit too close when watching!

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.040
What's wrong?

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.870
Why did you ask me to come out here?

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.090
If you're okay with me...

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.790
...I'd like you to wear this.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.000
Iwaki-kun...

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.970
If you don't want to,
just leave it there and go.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.560
Iwaki-kun.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.600
Come here.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.220
Could you zip up the back for me?

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.900
I've been waiting all this time, Iwaki-kun.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:09.090
Sensei.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.170
Call me "Natsumi."

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.560
N-Natsumi...

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.760
Darling!

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.380
Darling, Darling, Darling!!

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:22.640
Darling!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.600
Are you awake, Darling?

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:29.550
She ruined the best part <i>again</i>...

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.400
Of what?

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.520
Nothing!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.680
You'll be late for school!

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:38.380
Why are you smirking like that so
early in the morning? It's disgusting.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:41.950
It's a secret.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:18.010
Yes, We Did It! We Came Together!?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.160
I don't have to give up just yet, right?

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.650
She's not officially married yet, so...

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:32.780
Good morning, class!

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:33.570
Good morning!
Good morning, class!

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:35.750
Good morning!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:39.700
I know it's sudden, but I'm going
to introduce a new student today!

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:40.710
Come on in!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.560
Okay~!

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:49.130
This is Iwaki Rizel-chan.
She will be joining our class as of today!

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.600
Sensei, isn't that girl a grade-schooler?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.360
Bingo! Exactly correct!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.300
I'm Rizel.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.860
Sensei, if she's in grade school,
how can she come to middle school?

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.180
I don't really know,
but something like that, I guess.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.280
I'm pleased to meet you all!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.190
Not the "Power of the State" <i>again!</i>

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.190
Ah! Darling, I see you!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.270
Darling!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.280
Is that "Darling," as in "Husband"?!

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:18.770
Does she mean Iwaki?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.130
Who's this "Darling"?!
Does she mean Iwaki?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.560
Hey, hey, what's she
talking about, Iwaki-kun?

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.330
Hell if I know!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:28.740
But, but, we even filled out
the family registry form and everything!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.870
See?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:35.010
D-Don't get the wrong idea.
She did all that herself!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:37.480
Hubba hubba husband!

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.520
This way, we can be together
all day every day, Darling!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.150
It <i>does</i>  say "wife" right here.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:46.420
No matter what that says,
there's nothing going on between us!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.450
Oh come on, there's no need to get upset.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:52.870
There's no way a 15-year-old and
a 12-year-old could get married!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.230
But I'm impressed;
it looks just like the real thing.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.710
It <i>is</i>  the real thing!

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.580
You're so silly, Rizel-chan.
Anyway, your seat will be...

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.120
Right next to my husband!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:03.660
No! Next to Seimoto-san.
Right next to my husband!

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.870
No! Next to Seimoto-san.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:07.930
Here! Over here!

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.340
Don't complain! Just do what the teacher says!

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:14.930
Fine, but I wonder why it's so wrong...

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:17.800
I wish I could have sat next to my husband...

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:20.150
I'm Seimoto Aoi. Nice to meet you.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.390
Sure! I'm pleased to meet you!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:28.110
Being separated may be sad, but you can still
see Iwaki-kun pretty well from here.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.410
You're right!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.990
But that sure is a big bundle there. What is it?

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:36.630
A secret!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.900
Yes, yes! Good, good!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.850
First, a toast to the start of
a new phase in Rizel's life!

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.420
Oh, nice! Funakuchi pure sake!

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.550
Ah! Papas!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.560
Oh, Rizel.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.150
The school uniform looks good on you!

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.300
Make us proud.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:53.140
You three are Rizel-chan's guardians, right?

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.060
No, we are also transfer students!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.380
We may not look like it,
but we're middle-schoolers!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.440
Can you dig it? Groovy!

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.270
I'm just a random student...

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.960
I guess we failed.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.750
Yes, perhaps the sake toast blew our cover.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.240
We should have settled for sweet sake instead.

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.920
Do your best, Rizel!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.080
Yes, yes, yes, yes!!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.710
Rizel-chan, you'll do it?

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.460
No! But please, call on my husband!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:23.900
Don't you put <i>me</i> on the spot!
No! But please, call on my husband!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:24.880
Don't you put <i>me</i> on the spot!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.840
But I want to see you answering the question and looking cool!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.400
SHUT UP!!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.760
Same here.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.930
I'd love to hear your "cool" answer.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.410
Iwaki-kun it is, then!

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.770
It's settled! It's settled!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.730
Some joke <i>this</i>  is.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:48.760
This is a pretty tough one,
but I think you can handle it, Iwaki-kun.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.650
Show everyone how it's done.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:53.040
Oh well, an order's an order.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.550
Darling, you're awesome!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:01.060
Okay! Do your best, Darling!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:04.430
Burn with passion, Darling!

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:06.410
Yes! The number-one coolest husband!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.460
Knock it off!!
Yes! The number-one coolest husband!

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.960
That's... Argh!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.370
What are you trying to pull here?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.810
I just wanted to cheer for you.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:20.770
In what world would somebody do that that in a classroom?!

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:24.050
But, but, I researched that
cheering method at the library!

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.220
In what book in what library
did you read a thing like that?!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.190
It's the first time we've
touched face-to-face!

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:39.810
Listen up. If you cling to me me at school,
I won't pay attention to you at home!

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:43.150
It's my first time getting
all sticky with packing tape!

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.530
That boy is hopeless.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.800
That's okay. I've got a secret weapon
with me today!

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.380
Eh?? What, what?

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:56.190
It's a secret! And lunchtime just can't
get here fast enough!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.660
I'm all sleepy because I
stayed up all night preparing this.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:05.500
That is the girl with the
beautiful white underclothes!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.720
I have truly felt the blinding flash
of the light of destiny!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.570
It is as if she were born
and came here just for me!

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:19.030
Hey, I can't wait to see the secret weapon! Tell me what it is!

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.640
To tell, or not to tell?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.040
Seimoto-san.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.250
Might you spare a moment?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.790
Hououin-kun!

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.320
G-Good afternoon!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.140
Who's this?

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:32.340
Ah...Umm... She's R-R-Rizel-chan.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:34.770
She just t-t-transfered into our class today...

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.880
I see. Thank you very much.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.220
No problem...

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.900
Waah, he's just too dreamy!

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.310
Sorry!!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.760
I spoke to my idol, Hououin-kun,
for the first time!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.040
What a wonderful day this is!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.230
Noo~!

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:54.980
It is a pleasure to meet you.
My name is Hououin Ryuunosuke.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:58.120
I know it may be rude
to say this right away...

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.080
...but from the moment I first
laid eyes upon you,

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.220
your visage was burned into my mind,
and never has it left me since.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.930
You are none other than my ideal angel.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:11.670
I believe that God guided us on our paths,
so that we might meet here today.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.710
As a sign of our acquaintance,
might I have the honor...

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.640
...of introducing you to
my household this weekend?

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.860
Thank you for doing this for me.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.470
I shall be looking forward to it!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.770
My dear maiden!

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:40.000
Just when I thought you weren't showing up,
I find you asleep in the hallway!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:41.680
Are you all right?

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.400
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.790
Maybe you should rest in the nurse's office.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.930
I'm really just fine!

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.750
I'm trying my hardest to
make my stomach hungry for lunch!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.730
Wait for me, Darling!

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:57.780
Hey, wait! Wait up!!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.350
Wow, you stayed up all night
making a boxed lunch!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.630
His mom told me his favorites,

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.120
and since I couldn't make up my mind,
I made them all!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:18.940
Hey, come on, let me take a tiny peek at it!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.820
No way, it's embarrassing!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.240
Come on, it's all right!

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.310
Well, just a little bit.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.010
Wow, amazing!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.360
Thanks!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:32.290
This is really amazing! Even Iwaki-kun's sure to find <i>something</i>  he likes!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.240
You think so?

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:33.720
Yeah, yeah!
You think so?

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:34.240
Yeah, yeah!

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:36.960
Yay! Darling will be happy!

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:43.350
What's with this?!
Mom was slacking off again.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:44.790
Darling!

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.720
Let's have lunch together!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.470
Damn it, don't you ever shut up?!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.270
I <i>told</i>  you not to cling to me!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.620
You can't eat it anymore...

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.790
I didn't do it on purpose.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.410
What's <i>wrong</i>  with you?!

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.280
Rizel-chan stayed up all night making that! You're so mean!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:21.460
It's okay, Aoi-chan.
I can just make another one...

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.300
Rizel-chan? Rizel-chan!

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:32.290
How does it taste, Darling?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.130
Delicious, of course!

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.060
I'm so glad!

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:44.050
Geez, she sure is high-maintenance.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.690
Don't stay up all night just to make my lunch, you dummy.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:02.340
Huh? What about school?

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.530
It's been over for awhile now.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.260
Darling, did you carry me home?

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:08.990
Not like I had a choice.

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.310
Thank you, Darling!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:16.850
Argh, don't get the wrong idea!
I just did it because I had to!

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:20.640
And we're <i>not</i>  walking to school together just because we're in the same class.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:21.980
No!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.240
And don't stay up all night
just to make lunch again!

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:29.120
Why?! I thought I'd be able to
make a boxed lunch for you every day!

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.320
You don't have to take care of me, idiot!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.870
But I <i>want</i>  to!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.310
I'm sorry, Ri-!

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.540
Ah... er... Pleased to meet you.
S-Seimoto Aoi here.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.900
My relationship with Iwaki-kun?
Oh no, we're just childhood friends, I tell you.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:21.620
Even though he's like this now,
he used to be friendly and cheerful.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.770
Huh? It's over already?

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:31.940
Ah... er... Pleased to meet you.
S-Seimoto Aoi here. Ah, I'm so nervous...

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:36.310
My relationship with Iwaki-kun?
Oh no, we're just childhood friends, I tell you.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.760
When we were kids, we lived next door
to each other in an apartment complex.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:43.520
Even though he's like this now,
he used to be friendly and cheerful.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:47.370
So when did he get to be like that, anyway? And why, I wonder?

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:51.680
I really think that he shouldn't
be so uptight with Rizel-chan.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.990
Huh? It's over already?
